Epoch_roundTrip
├── given a depositor deposits in epoch N and claims shares
├── and a parent-local rebalance finalizes before the next withdraw epoch
├── when management fee shares dilute totalShares during rebalance
├── and the depositor withdraws all claimed shares in epoch N + 1
├── then the epoch closes claimable through the workflow router
├── and the depositor can claim the fee-adjusted and rounding-adjusted USDC amount
├── and the claimed amount must not exceed the original deposit
└── and the depositor's deposit and withdraw mappings are cleared
